ernate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq62pn6j42jko--90dea8d2d192.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cq62pn6j42jko?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The jump in Nvidia shares has also lifted stock markets, with the tech-heavy Nasdaq up 6.5%.</summary></entry><entry><title>How important are Nvidia and Jensen Huang to the US economy?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo#0</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:07:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T16:12:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo--9194ddb07971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c68798vdprwpo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The Nvidia chief executive has been at the centre of the artificial intelligence boom.</summary></entry><entry><title>The rise and fall and rise again of Jensen Huang</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmze750zg0jeo#0</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:07:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T15:49:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmze750zg0jeo--00916c7a76a8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmze750zg0jeo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Days after resigning while mired in scandal of extra-marital affairs, Nvidia's Jensen Huang is making a remarkable return.</summary></entry><entry><title>GTA 6 hacker released on licence with warning 'don't let this happen again'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqpv9kr7pxmro#0</id><updated>2026-11-24T10:07:20Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T14:08:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqpv9kr7pxmro--c2c96bd84b3b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqpv9kr7pxmro?at_medium=RSS&a